From 0b9abb5aa4988df942e7de7acb9ade5e8e0ffc2d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: c4ffein <c4ffein.work@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 6 Jul 2026 12:44:52 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 6/6] Add 10 improvements in parallel: dark mode, code-split,
 a11y, D3 tests, PyTorch RNN, dataset UX, chat hardening, legacy cleanup, tfjs
 training test

Integrated from nine independent subagent branches (each built on the prior HEAD), merged
with git's 3-way strategy (zero textual conflicts) and one combined verification pass.

1. Dark mode + theme v0.1: semantic token set in App.vue, dark palette via prefers-color-scheme
   and a persisted [data-theme] toggle in the menu; 8 components tokenized.
2. Code-split TensorFlow.js: lazy dynamic import (src/lib/tf/loadTf.js) + manualChunks; entry
   bundle 2,674 kB -> 606 kB, tfjs in its own on-demand chunk.
3. Chat-assistant hardening: read-only-by-default guardrail on mutating tools, robust Anthropic
   client error handling (401/429/5xx/network/malformed/maxTurns), input validation (+23 tests).
4. D3 layer/graph unit tests: 48 jsdom tests for D3Model/D3Edge/D3GraphEditor/D3Interface; fixes a
   real debugGetBoardState bug (referenced .model.layers/.edges instead of d3Layers/d3Edges).
6. PyTorch codegen: Embedding + LSTM/GRU/SimpleRNN (batch_first) with correct tuple-return forward
   handling (x, _ = self.lstm(x) + last-timestep slice); unsupported layers still emit # TODO.
7. Remove dead legacy-backend/ (retired Python backend) + add docs/datasets.md, link from README.
8. Dataset-load error UX: visible error state + Retry in DatasetSelector (e2e-verified via the
   blocked fetch).
9. tfjs-4 training smoke-test: synthetic-data model.fit under v4 (sequential + functional + the
   generated flatten->dense->dense), proving training works with no network.
10. Accessibility pass: ARIA roles/names, keyboard operability, focus traps + Esc on dialogs across
   13 components; tests/a11y.spec.js.

Also: playwright.config testMatch '**/*.spec.js' so the whole-dir e2e run stops colliding with the
vitest tests/unit/*.test.js files.

Verified together: lint 0/0, 137 unit tests (10 files), build ok, non-network e2e 60/60
(28 UI/new specs + 32 core-features); only the ~4 network-blocked MNIST tests fail (environmental).
Not exercisable in this sandbox: live LLM chat (needs API key), in-browser tfjs-4 training on real
GPU, WebGPU backend.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>
